**PART A — direction**
- **A1 (settled already):** No. The direction is the cycle-155 decision itself (`docs/d1/ring-p5.md:142-153`, PD378(a), 2026-10-09). It is not an older settlement that this card repeats. The tool fix it depends on landed in card 155-a1-1 (`tools/bench/diag_c155_a1_1_facts.md:13-18`, stagexec 53e17623 / stagesim eb99c6ba). That is the plan's prerequisite, not prior art that replaces the plan.
